# consema-go: minimal .gitignore. The Go toolchain builds into its own cache
# and produces no in-tree artifacts except the CI coverage profile
# (go/coverage.out, generated by the CI coverage job — see below; G063,
# adversarial audit 2026-08-13).

# IDE / OS artifacts
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Conformance data: test-run-time provision. CI multi-repo checkouts copy it
# from the consema/consema spec repository; local runs require a manual copy
# (see CONTRIBUTING.md "Conformance 数据同步"). The spec repository is the
# single authority — kept out of git here to avoid a second authority.
# Anchored at the repository root (/conformance/): the provisioned data
# directory only. go/conformance/ (Go source) must stay trackable.
/conformance/
docs/fc-manifest-0.13.0.json

# Go coverage profile (generated at go/coverage.out by the CI coverage job)
go/coverage.out
